Example 1:

Input: nums = [0,1,0,3,12]
Output: [1,3,12,0,0]
Example 2:

Input: nums = [0]
Output: [0]

solution :
nums=list(map(int,input().split()))
left =0
for right in range(len(nums)):
    if nums[right] != 0 :
        nums[left],nums[right]= nums[right],nums[left]
        left+=1
    else:
        skip
print(nums)
